FFmpeg is downloaded at build time into this directory and bundled with
Audio Compare as a sidecar. The binaries are not stored in git.

Source release: https://github.com/eugeneware/ffmpeg-static/releases/tag/b6.1.1
Upstream FFmpeg: https://ffmpeg.org

Those builds are GPL (they include GPL-licensed encoders such as x264 in
some packages, and LAME/Opus for this app). Audio Compare itself remains
MIT-licensed; FFmpeg is a separate program invoked as a child process.

The corresponding license text is written to FFMPEG-LICENSE when
`npm run prepare-ffmpeg` runs.
